LIMITED EVALUATION PERMISSION

If the copyright holder has given you access to this repository as a named
evaluator, you may, for the purpose of evaluating the software and reporting
back on it:

  1. Clone the repository and run it against your own code.
  2. Modify your own working copy as needed to make it run in your
     environment.
  3. Share your findings, including quoted excerpts of the source, with the
     copyright holder.

